  "bio": "Adri Metric, based in Barcelona, Spain, is a highly skilled and professional tattoo artist specializing in intricate tribal and geometric styles. Having a residency stint at @akaberlin every week showcases not only his dedication but also his mastery of his craft that is worth noting. You can contact him through his email at Adrimetric@gmail.com for any inquiries or booking appointments.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Barcelona, Catalonia, Spain\n\n🏭 BCN 🕸️🕷️37🗝️ @chicapanteratattoo \n🇩🇪BERLIN 5/6/7 MARCH ⏳\n🌉GIRONA @threetigerstattoo \n☎️ +34 648 458 958\n🏜️ @a.estelax \n🌶️D*CKTTT👇",
